ed Z2 cell, reads the 3x4 and 4x4 boxes, and the Ising anchor fixes the infinite-lattice series through u^12; GATE 3 (ARM 7): the Cayley gaps of Q8, 2T, 2O, 2I are 6, 4, 6 - 3 sqrt2 and 12 - 6 phi, the fundamental's at each with nothing below, the desk's seven factorizations met, the dihedral nearest shells refused by name; STAKE 8 (ARM 8): the inertia road brackets every certified Z2 cell by sign counts alone, the dual road's lambdas inside and ΤΟΜΕΥΣ' intervals met, 14 of 14
